environment-specific configuration
secure secrets
454. Design framework for banking.
⭐ Interview Answer

“For banking, I would design the framework around UI, API and database validation because many financial workflows require end-to-end verification.

For example, in a fund-transfer workflow, I could initiate the transaction through UI or API, validate the API response, and verify the transaction status in the database.

I would give special attention to test-data isolation, transaction uniqueness, security of credentials, audit logs and reliable cleanup.

Because banking applications are highly critical, I would keep retries controlled and avoid blindly retrying financial transactions.”

🔥 Excellent client-round point:

Never blindly retry a payment or fund-transfer operation.

