457. How would you support multiple environments?
⭐ Interview Answer

“I would externalize environment-specific configuration instead of hard-coding URLs or credentials.”

Example:

config/
 ├── qa.properties
 ├── staging.properties
 └── prod.properties

QA:

baseUrl=https://qa.example.com

Staging:

